### Executive Summary

- Creative Horizons Studios, Inc. focuses on film and television production, talent management, and distribution.
- The company aims to expand its reach in international markets while optimizing intellectual property (IP) management.
- Key goals for FY 2024:
  - Increase production output by 30% 
  - Expand into three new international territories
  - Enhance IP licensing revenue by 25%

